    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet Boom!</strong> is a fun and vibrant cartoon-style game for the whole family! Get ready for a burst of sweets and exciting battles in a colorful world where each map is themed around candies and sweets. Enjoy thrilling modes like battle royale, team battles, free-for-all, and unique trap-filled maps. Perfect for friendly evenings \u2014 team up in co-op, compete in multiplayer, and prove who the sweetest champion is! Are you ready to explode into fun? Let\u2019s go for victory in <strong>Sweet Boom!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/extras/70bc95e87eec0c9b777e3561b85bfc91.avif?t=1752335169\" width=800 height=530 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet Boom!</strong> is a fun and vibrant cartoon-style game for the whole family! Get ready for a burst of sweets and exciting battles in a colorful world where each map is themed around candies and sweets. Enjoy thrilling modes like battle royale, team battles, free-for-all, and unique trap-filled maps. Perfect for friendly evenings \u2014 team up in co-op, compete in multiplayer, and prove who the sweetest champion is! Are you ready to explode into fun? Let\u2019s go for victory in <strong>Sweet Boom!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830070/extras/70bc95e87eec0c9b777e3561b85bfc91.avif?t=1752335169\" width=800 height=530 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Sweet Boom! is a colorful, cartoon-style game for the whole family! Enjoy battle royale, team battles, and free-for-alls across sweet-themed maps full of traps and surprises. Team up in co-op or compete online \u2014 fun, action, and plenty of sweets await! Let\u2019s burst into fun!",
